              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h2>Requires less steps</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">to access the hip joint compared to the traditional technique<sup style=\"font-family: HumanistSlab712W01, Cambria, Palatino, serif;\">​1</sup></span></p>\n",
